[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 784.87, "timestamp": "00:13:04", "text": "ああ、神様。 待って、待って、ポータルに行くにはどこへ行けばいいの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 788.389, "timestamp": "00:13:08", "text": "アストラに、彼の世界はPC専用なので参加できないと伝えてくれ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 791.19, "timestamp": "00:13:11", "text": "。   駆け上がってください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 792.15, "timestamp": "00:13:12", "text": "。 上へ行け。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 792.71, "timestamp": "00:13:12", "text": "付与された。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 803.435, "timestamp": "00:13:23", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/W8IfY_bwAfiPq7IPvNCA2AU"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 805.35, "timestamp": "00:13:25", "text": "うん。 ああ、私たちはあなたの世界には入れません。 ここは"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 805.875, "timestamp": "00:13:25", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! astravt~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 808.55, "timestamp": "00:13:28", "text": "PC（ポリコレ）の世界だ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 810.87, "timestamp": "00:13:30", "text": "これは自作PCです。 あ、待って。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 812.47, "timestamp": "00:13:32", "text": "インターネット接続は復旧しましたか？ よし、戻ってきた。 復活した"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 813.245, "timestamp": "00:13:33", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 814.15, "timestamp": "00:13:34", "text": "。"},